# Dev vault (cargo run -- serve ./devvault). Unanchored on purpose: a second
# devvault/ anywhere in the tree makes that command mean different things from
# different directories, because cargo finds Cargo.toml by walking up while the
# path argument stays relative to where you are standing.
devvault/

